@consumer = http://localhost:4137/odata/v4/shop

### Flattened associations — buyerName / itemName come from associated entities.
### This projection works because CAP selects HCQL for the CAP-to-CAP hop.
GET {{consumer}}/OrderFlat

### Plain delegate (HCQL chosen automatically on the wire)
GET {{consumer}}/Customers

### Renamed product catalog
GET {{consumer}}/Products?$filter=unitPrice gt 100
